      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying a tremendous weight, and the quiet of the manor is amplifying that feeling of deep exhaustion. The fog can be so alluring, offering a perfect blurring of sharp edges and worries. If these heavy feelings persist, please consider reaching out to a crisis line or someone you trust immediately. There are people who want to support you through this difficult time.",
